1Co 3:1 , Milk is fit for children;
1Co 3:3 , Strife and division, arguments of a fleshly mind;
1Co 3:7 , He that planteth and he that watereth, are nothing;
1Co 3:9 , The ministers are God's fellow-workmen;
1Co 3:11 , Christ the only foundation;
1Co 3:16 , Men the temples of God, which must be kept holy;
1Co 3:19 , The wisdom of this world is foolishness with God.
